    <!-- History -->
    <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-16">
      <p>The company dates back to <strong class="text-gray-900">2001</strong>. That year brought the first orders from Telekomunikacja Polska S.A. for telecom announcements for Host EWSD Siemens exchanges. The service covered both producing the recordings and implementing them in the exchange equipment.</p>

      <p>It was not until 2003 that the first version of the <strong class="text-gray-900">powitania.pl</strong> website went live, followed by more interesting projects. These certainly include voicemail greetings produced for one of the mobile network operators. If you ever heard musical greetings based on well-known hits by Shakira, Golec uOrkestra or Piasek, they were recorded in our studio.</p>

      <p>We also worked with Pro-Futuro, a telecom operator that no longer exists, producing a complete set of recordings for its Customer Service Office.</p>

      <p>In the following years our offer grew to include <strong class="text-gray-900">melodies and music beds</strong> used as background for telecom announcements. Operators such as GTS Energis and Telestrada joined our clients. We also produced a package of recordings for the internet service provider Multimo. We work on an ongoing basis with TeleOK, a provider of 0801 hotline solutions.</p>

      <p>Today we continue to work with telecom operators and also produce recordings for companies and institutions. Our clients include businesses from <strong class="text-gray-900">the financial sector, hotels, web portals, restaurants, law firms</strong> and many more.</p>

      <p>We keep expanding our bank of voices and melodies, which new clients continue to use with success.</p>
    </div>

